    "BOKKI Plan은 위치·건강·캘린더·사진·앱 사용시간을 읽어 하루를 대신 적습니다. 필요한 것만 허용해도 되고, 설정에서 언제든 바꿀 수 있습니다." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan reads your location, health, calendar, photos, and app usage to record your day for you. Allow only what you need, and change permissions anytime in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BOKKI Plan은 위치·건강·캘린더를 읽어 하루를 대신 적습니다. 필요한 것만 허용해도 되고, 설정에서 언제든 바꿀 수 있습니다." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan reads your location, health data, and calendars to record your day for you. Allow only what you need, and change permissions anytime in Settings."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Planは位置情報、ヘルスケアデータ、カレンダーを読み取って、あなたの1日を自動で記録します。必要なものだけを許可し、設定からいつでも許可を変更できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan 会读取你的位置、健康数据和日历来为你记录一天。只允许你需要的权限，随时可在“设置”中更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan 會讀取你的位置、健康資料和行事曆，為你記錄一天。請只允許你需要的項目，並隨時可在「設定」中更改權限。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan liest deinen Standort, deine Health-Daten und Kalender, um deinen Tag für dich aufzuzeichnen. Erlaube nur, was du brauchst, und ändere Berechtigungen jederzeit in den Einstellungen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan lit votre position, vos données de santé et vos calendriers pour enregistrer votre journée à votre place. N'autorisez que le nécessaire et modifiez les autorisations à tout moment dans Réglages."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan legge posizione, dati sulla salute e calendari per registrare la tua giornata al posto tuo. Consenti solo ciò che ti serve e cambia i permessi quando vuoi in Impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan lee tu ubicación, datos de salud y calendarios para registrar tu día por ti. Permite solo lo que necesites y cambia los permisos cuando quieras en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O BOKKI Plan lê sua localização, dados de saúde e calendários para registrar o seu dia por você. Permita só o que precisar e mude as permissões quando quiser em Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan đọc vị trí, dữ liệu sức khỏe và lịch của bạn để ghi lại ngày của bạn. Chỉ cho phép những gì bạn cần và đổi quyền bất cứ lúc nào trong Cài đặt."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan membaca lokasi, data kesehatan, dan kalender Anda untuk mencatat hari Anda. Izinkan hanya yang Anda perlukan, dan ubah izin kapan saja di Pengaturan."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan อ่านตำแหน่ง ข้อมูลสุขภาพ และปฏิทินของคุณเพื่อบันทึกวันของคุณให้ เลือกอนุญาตเฉพาะที่จำเป็น และเปลี่ยนสิทธิ์ได้ทุกเมื่อใน การตั้งค่า"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BOKKI Plan आपका दिन अपने-आप दर्ज करने के लिए आपका स्थान, स्वास्थ्य डेटा और कैलेंडर पढ़ता है। सिर्फ़ ज़रूरी अनुमतियाँ दें, और कभी भी सेटिंग्ज़ में बदलें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
